00:03:30.910 --> 00:03:33.080
Head Master told me I would be invisible.

00:03:33.080 --> 00:03:35.070
I swear! Please believe me.

00:03:35.680 --> 00:03:37.170
And, who are you?

00:03:37.550 --> 00:03:40.780
Oh! I'm Shinobu!

00:03:41.220 --> 00:03:44.310
I'm a ninja trainee who goes to a ninja school.

00:03:44.490 --> 00:03:46.280
