00:03:47.190 --> 00:03:49.490
N-Ninja?

00:03:49.490 --> 00:03:51.720
Yes, a ninja! You know?

00:03:51.930 --> 00:03:52.890
"Nin-Nin!"

00:03:53.230 --> 00:03:54.420
Just kidding!

00:03:55.130 --> 00:03:57.270
And what is a ninja doing here?

00:03:57.270 --> 00:03:58.930
