00:03:58.930 --> 00:04:02.300
Well, I'm in the middle of an exam, so...

00:04:02.400 --> 00:04:03.430
Exam?

00:04:06.110 --> 00:04:09.940
From Ninja Department, Female Ninja
Studies, Shinobu. At your call!

00:04:11.480 --> 00:04:13.350
