00:04:18.650 --> 00:04:19.880
Yes, Head Master!

00:04:19.990 --> 00:04:22.390
Choose one of the following exam criteria.

00:04:22.660 --> 00:04:24.150
Number one: Abolish taxes.

00:04:24.260 --> 00:04:26.930
Number two: Collect 10,000 yen in
fines from every couple in the city.

00:04:26.930 --> 00:04:29.130
Number three: Pinch a Martian and make it cry.

00:04:29.130 --> 00:04:30.200
Number four: Cross the Pacific Ocean...

00:04:30.200 --> 00:04:30.470
...on a rubber duck raft.

00:04:30.470 --> 00:04:31.270
They're all impossible!
...on a rubber duck raft.

00:04:31.270 --> 00:04:32.000
They're all impossible!
Number five: Stuff peanuts up your nose...

00:04:32.000 --> 00:04:32.500
Number five: Stuff peanuts up your nose...

00:04:32.500 --> 00:04:33.940
...and shoot them 100 meters.

00:04:33.940 --> 00:04:36.230
Number six: Thumb wrestle a wild bear.

00:04:36.770 --> 00:04:39.440
Number nine-hundred and ninety-nine:
Let it keep on-a-flowin'.

00:04:39.440 --> 00:04:40.910
Number one-thousand:
Hold a bat between your legs...

00:04:40.910 --> 00:04:42.010
...and hit a homerun.

00:04:42.010 --> 00:04:44.710
Now, which one do you choose?

00:04:45.080 --> 00:04:47.780
Umm... Out of the ones I can do today...

00:04:48.720 --> 00:04:51.350
Then, I'd like to go with number
four-hundred and twelve, please.

00:04:51.890 --> 00:04:53.560
Number four-hundred and twelve.

00:04:53.560 --> 00:04:56.120
I see. Wasn't expecting that one...

00:04:56.430 --> 00:04:58.830
I honestly don't want to do that either, but...

00:04:59.060 --> 00:05:00.720
Okay!

00:05:01.330 --> 00:05:03.800
Off you go, now!

00:05:04.330 --> 00:05:04.990
Yes!

00:05:05.330 --> 00:05:08.460
I, Shinobu, am off to accomplish my mission!

00:05:09.270 --> 00:05:11.330
And that's how it went.

00:05:11.910 --> 00:05:14.740
So what's number four-hundred and twelve?

00:05:14.840 --> 00:05:15.830
Tadaa!

00:05:16.080 --> 00:05:19.610
Collect underwear from high school girls!

00:05:19.920 --> 00:05:22.580
Collect underwear from high school girls?

00:05:22.750 --> 00:05:25.910
They're located at these spots marked in red.

00:05:27.990 --> 00:05:30.990
H-Hey! My house is marked, too!

00:05:30.990 --> 00:05:33.330
Oh! Really?!

00:05:33.500 --> 00:05:35.590
Are you Kaede from the Shiranui household?

00:05:36.700 --> 00:05:37.890
Well, yeah, but...

00:05:39.640 --> 00:05:41.970
H-Hold on! You've got to be kidding!

00:05:42.100 --> 00:05:42.870
Kaede...

00:05:43.210 --> 00:05:46.540
To a ninja, Head Master's orders are absolute.

00:05:46.980 --> 00:05:49.810
If Head Master says he has
a cat-girl maid, he has one.

00:05:50.280 --> 00:05:52.080
If Head Master says he has
an adorable younger sister...

00:05:52.080 --> 00:05:53.670
...not related by blood, he does!

00:05:53.750 --> 00:05:56.550
What kind of bizarre way of thinking is that!?

00:05:57.250 --> 00:05:58.690
With that said,

00:05:58.690 --> 00:06:02.620
I will accomplish my mission, no matter what!

00:06:02.960 --> 00:06:05.690
Art of the Doppelganger Technique!

00:06:17.840 --> 00:06:19.270
Sorry!

00:06:19.270 --> 00:06:21.110
I am still a trainee...

00:06:21.940 --> 00:06:24.380
I think this is more effective, anyway.

00:06:25.010 --> 00:06:26.240
Um...

00:06:26.350 --> 00:06:28.410
Then, I'll use my ninja stars next...

00:06:30.350 --> 00:06:32.620
I'm so sorry!

00:06:33.220 --> 00:06:35.710
I got this cute ninja star pouch.

00:06:36.230 --> 00:06:38.630
But I didn't want to get holes
in it or have it smell like iron,

00:06:38.630 --> 00:06:40.750
