00:09:44.910 --> 00:09:48.050
You're ero-ero-mucho-mucho-mucho...

00:09:48.050 --> 00:09:49.350
Mucho-cho!

00:09:50.050 --> 00:09:51.420
No, I'm not!

00:09:51.420 --> 00:09:52.120
Mucho!
No, I'm not!

00:09:52.120 --> 00:09:53.050
Mucho!

00:09:56.290 --> 00:10:00.250
But... stealing underwear is
a perverse and bad thing to do.

00:10:01.130 --> 00:10:03.290
Plus, Kaede doesn't really like it either...

00:10:03.570 --> 00:10:06.060
I want to become a ninja of justice.

00:10:06.270 --> 00:10:07.670
I can't do this!

00:10:08.840 --> 00:10:11.070
I give up on this exam...

00:10:15.810 --> 00:10:18.510
I'm sure I won't miss one pair of
underwear, so you can have it.

00:10:18.810 --> 00:10:21.410
I know how difficult exams can be.

00:10:22.220 --> 00:10:22.840
Here.

00:10:28.620 --> 00:10:30.110
Thank you so much!

00:10:30.390 --> 00:10:32.420
I'm forever in your debt!

00:10:33.230 --> 00:10:37.690
As for my exam, it was terrible.

00:10:38.130 --> 00:10:41.100
