00:10:47.640 --> 00:10:49.510
Art of Invisibility Technique...

00:10:50.250 --> 00:10:51.110
Yeah!

00:10:52.450 --> 00:10:53.470
You're...

00:10:55.150 --> 00:10:58.480
You can still see me? Silly me...

00:10:58.820 --> 00:11:00.620
Actually, for tonight's exam,

00:11:00.620 --> 00:11:02.560
I have to get a hicky from a high-school girl.

