Oh my...

00:11:19.680 --> 00:11:20.280
The Head Master Appears!

00:11:20.280 --> 00:11:22.380
The Head Master Appears
The Head Master Appears!

00:11:22.380 --> 00:11:23.900
The Head Master Appears

00:11:28.580 --> 00:11:28.720
See you!

