Bye bye!

00:11:29.320 --> 00:11:29.550
Bye bye!
Have a good night.

00:11:29.550 --> 00:11:30.280
Have a good night.

00:11:36.160 --> 00:11:38.130
How are you doing, Kaede?

00:11:38.990 --> 00:11:41.200
I made a cool entrance,

00:11:41.200 --> 00:11:43.130
