00:12:02.180 --> 00:12:03.880
Yay! Clap, clap, clap!

00:12:04.750 --> 00:12:07.090
By the way, thank you for the other day!

00:12:07.290 --> 00:12:08.880
I passed the exam with flying colors,

00:12:09.190 --> 00:12:11.820
and your underwear got me a high score!

00:12:12.690 --> 00:12:15.130
Oh... Good for you.

00:12:15.300 --> 00:12:17.460
Yes! Thank you so much!

00:12:18.730 --> 00:12:20.200
A meow-meow!

00:12:21.500 --> 00:12:22.570
As a thank you,

00:12:22.570 --> 00:12:27.510
I've come to invite you
to the Valley of the Ninjas!

00:12:27.740 --> 00:12:30.350
No, you don't have to do that...

00:12:30.350 --> 00:12:32.310
Come on! There's no need to be shy!

00:12:32.810 --> 00:12:36.080
The wheels of fate have already started turning!

00:12:36.350 --> 00:12:40.050
We may end up changing the history
of the future if we don't hurry!

00:12:41.860 --> 00:12:44.020
Hold on tight!

00:12:44.160 --> 00:12:45.190
If you let go,

00:12:45.190 --> 00:12:47.420
