00:12:55.700 --> 00:12:57.330
We're finally here.

00:12:57.740 --> 00:12:59.730
That was such a rough trip.

00:13:08.620 --> 00:13:10.710
I... I thought I was going to die.

00:13:10.890 --> 00:13:11.850
But, come on!

00:13:11.850 --> 00:13:14.480
"You can't buy great memories," right?

00:13:15.620 --> 00:13:17.520
What was so great about that!?

00:13:18.530 --> 00:13:20.590
Kaede is really angry!

00:13:21.400 --> 00:13:23.590
Is there any way to calm her down?

00:13:24.330 --> 00:13:25.560
Oh, that's right!

00:13:26.540 --> 00:13:28.470
Ninja Technique Story!

00:13:29.300 --> 00:13:31.870
"Man... my wife and I had a fight last night."

00:13:31.870 --> 00:13:34.600
"She was throwing plates at me. It was rough!"

00:13:35.240 --> 00:13:37.840
