00:13:38.150 --> 00:13:39.980
"Really? What did you do?"

00:13:40.450 --> 00:13:42.420
"I planted a kiss..."

00:13:42.420 --> 00:13:42.720
What the! Stop it!
"I planted a kiss..."

00:13:42.720 --> 00:13:44.780
What the! Stop it!

00:13:45.750 --> 00:13:47.120
That's strange.

00:13:47.120 --> 00:13:50.430
I saw on TV that you could
make up with someone that way.

00:13:50.430 --> 00:13:52.660
That's for a fight between a husband and wife!

00:13:52.830 --> 00:13:56.060
Also, adding "Ninja Technique" before
everything doesn't make it work!

00:13:56.430 --> 00:13:58.260
Your ninja technique didn't work?

00:13:59.730 --> 00:14:00.720
Onsokumaru!

00:14:01.340 --> 00:14:05.170
Shinobu, that's because you have
yet to master the techniques!

00:14:05.440 --> 00:14:08.340
Come! Let us train together now!

00:14:08.740 --> 00:14:10.270
I'm sorry, Onsokumaru.

00:14:10.510 --> 00:14:12.750
I've invited Kaede over,

00:14:12.750 --> 00:14:14.720
so I can't do anything with you today.

00:14:14.880 --> 00:14:19.450
How dare you coldly brush me off
with such passionate eyes!

00:14:19.450 --> 00:14:20.890
Unforgivable!

00:14:21.060 --> 00:14:23.830
A ninja will find the opponent's
weakness in an instant...

00:14:23.830 --> 00:14:25.380
...and strike!

00:14:25.630 --> 00:14:29.390
Go if you must, but only
over my dead body, Shinobu!

00:14:30.470 --> 00:14:32.160
Here goes nothing!

00:14:33.500 --> 00:14:36.030
Defeated by the first blow!

00:14:36.400 --> 00:14:40.900
U... Unfortunately... Th...
This isn't m-my weakness...

00:14:42.910 --> 00:14:46.850
My weakness is to be squished
between your breasts!

00:14:49.120 --> 00:14:50.650
As expected, Onsokumaru.

00:14:50.650 --> 00:14:53.380
As an enemy, no one strikes
me with more fear than you.

00:14:53.760 --> 00:14:55.450
Now, it's my turn!

00:14:56.190 --> 00:15:01.030
I'll show you a flipbook of
someone shitting in reverse!

00:15:01.960 --> 00:15:04.400
That's gross! I give up!

00:15:04.400 --> 00:15:05.100
Look! Look! See how it's sucking it back in!
That's gross! I give up!

00:15:05.100 --> 00:15:07.330
Look! Look! See how it's sucking it back in!

00:15:08.640 --> 00:15:10.260
I'm sorry, Kaede...

00:15:10.670 --> 00:15:13.230
I invited you over, but now I've failed you...

00:15:13.840 --> 00:15:16.310
I'm such a no-good-ninja.

00:15:17.210 --> 00:15:18.370
Don't worry about it!

00:15:18.710 --> 00:15:20.010
I guess I'll go home now.

00:15:26.120 --> 00:15:28.210
This is the entrance to the Ninja Manor.

00:15:28.460 --> 00:15:31.250
I don't care. I'm going home.

00:15:31.730 --> 00:15:32.780
Please don't move!

00:15:33.560 --> 00:15:35.360
If anyone acts suspicious...

00:15:35.360 --> 00:15:38.230
...in front of the Ninja Manor
where the Head Master lives...

00:15:38.530 --> 00:15:40.830
...death immediately awaits them!

00:15:43.310 --> 00:15:45.640
Please stay still and don't move!

00:15:46.270 --> 00:15:46.930
Okay.

00:15:53.920 --> 00:15:58.440
? Head Master! Let's play! It's Shinobu!?

00:16:00.690 --> 00:16:01.920
? Who's there??

00:16:02.360 --> 00:16:04.830
Oh, it's Shinobu!

00:16:04.830 --> 00:16:05.850
Yay!
Yay!

00:16:06.230 --> 00:16:08.590
Mr. Gatekeeper, is Head Master here?

00:16:08.760 --> 00:16:10.130
He is.

00:16:11.570 --> 00:16:13.090
Is that your friend?

00:16:13.300 --> 00:16:13.890
Yup!

00:16:14.270 --> 00:16:16.970
Guys! Hurry up and slip through the gate...

00:16:16.970 --> 00:16:18.940
...while I still have the strength to hold it!

00:16:18.940 --> 00:16:19.770
Okay!

00:16:22.510 --> 00:16:24.100
This house is amazing.

00:16:24.680 --> 00:16:26.980
It really looks like a ninja house!

00:16:30.290 --> 00:16:31.310
Head Master!

00:16:33.520 --> 00:16:35.350
Doesn't seem like he's here.

00:16:41.260 --> 00:16:42.160
Head Master?

00:16:42.760 --> 00:16:45.100
Fools! The Head Master is dead!

00:16:45.570 --> 00:16:48.230
And you will die here as well!

00:16:49.040 --> 00:16:51.160
Hello, Head Master!

00:16:52.540 --> 00:16:56.070
Would it have been better if
I acted like I was surprised?

00:16:56.210 --> 00:16:58.050
Well, either way is fine.

00:16:58.050 --> 00:16:59.080
Oh, good.

00:16:59.080 --> 00:17:00.740
What's with this conversation?

00:17:00.850 --> 00:17:02.480
I'll be there in a sec.

00:17:05.620 --> 00:17:07.780
A rainbow? How'd that get here?

00:17:08.420 --> 00:17:09.960
Yahoo!

00:17:09.960 --> 00:17:12.630
I'm making my adorable entrance
sliding down a rainbow...

00:17:12.630 --> 00:17:15.320
...like an angel up to mischief
descending from the Heavens!

00:17:15.400 --> 00:17:16.130
That's right!

00:17:16.430 --> 00:17:18.400
I am!

00:17:18.400 --> 00:17:20.640
I am the Head Master!

00:17:20.640 --> 00:17:23.330
Here, would everyone like some tea?

00:17:26.370 --> 00:17:28.410
You aimed for it! You aimed for it, didn't you?

00:17:28.410 --> 00:17:31.440
Tell me the truth or I'll kill you!

00:17:31.880 --> 00:17:34.180
No, no... Of course not.

00:17:34.520 --> 00:17:36.310
It was pure coincidence.

00:17:37.150 --> 00:17:39.480
I'm losing my strength...

00:17:39.850 --> 00:17:41.760
Hang in there, family jewels!

00:17:41.760 --> 00:17:42.020
The one with the beard is Head Master.
Hang in there, family jewels!

00:17:42.020 --> 00:17:43.920
The one with the beard is Head Master.

00:17:45.060 --> 00:17:47.820
But isn't that... Onsokumaru?

00:17:48.960 --> 00:17:51.960
He's Onsokumaru! No matter how I look at him.

00:17:53.130 --> 00:17:55.000
N-No! I have no idea who you are.

00:17:55.100 --> 00:17:58.400
Plus, I'm not Onsokumaru.

00:17:58.570 --> 00:18:01.040
See? I don't look like him at all!

00:18:01.240 --> 00:18:03.340
I'll commend you for your
effort, but it's so obvious.

00:18:03.410 --> 00:18:04.940
Oh, come on Kaede!

00:18:05.080 --> 00:18:07.710
Onsokumaru doesn't have a beard!

00:18:07.980 --> 00:18:11.180
Tell her Shinobu! She's so stupid!

00:18:12.950 --> 00:18:16.360
Fine! Then, call Onsokumaru here right now.

00:18:16.420 --> 00:18:18.090
No problem!

00:18:19.160 --> 00:18:21.530
Hold it right there, ladies!

00:18:22.730 --> 00:18:25.400
Go on! Shinobu, call Onsokumaru!

00:18:25.400 --> 00:18:26.960
No problem!

00:18:27.440 --> 00:18:30.230
Y-You mustn't call him, Shinobu!

00:18:30.610 --> 00:18:35.440
He's in the middle of training a special
technique that turns piss into beer!

00:18:35.980 --> 00:18:40.280
If you call him, the witch's curse
will make your television explode!

00:18:40.280 --> 00:18:41.540
I'm telling you the truth!

00:18:42.220 --> 00:18:43.680
That would be bad!

00:18:44.390 --> 00:18:48.220
My TV has a VCR inside.
I'd be heartbroken!

00:18:48.290 --> 00:18:50.690
I'm sorry, I can't call Onsokumaru!

00:18:50.690 --> 00:18:51.950
Please forgive me!

00:18:57.270 --> 00:19:00.170
Now, now. Cut it out, little missy.

00:19:00.700 --> 00:19:03.470
Ow. Ow!

00:19:04.370 --> 00:19:08.570
Anyway! What is a girl like you doing here?

00:19:09.610 --> 00:19:12.710
This is a secret training location only ninjas know!

00:19:14.150 --> 00:19:15.250
He's right!

00:19:15.250 --> 00:19:16.680
Outsiders who discover our secret...

00:19:16.680 --> 00:19:19.240
...aren't allowed to leave alive. That's the law!

00:19:19.490 --> 00:19:20.580
Then what about me?

00:19:21.390 --> 00:19:25.050
Oh... Now that you mention it,
you're definitely an outsider.

00:19:25.130 --> 00:19:27.750
I totally forgot. Scratch, scratch.

00:19:28.100 --> 00:19:29.930
J-Just hold on a minute, here!

00:19:38.440 --> 00:19:41.670
I didn't realize it at first because
you were acting so bold!

00:19:41.810 --> 00:19:43.470
Shinobu! Do it!

00:19:45.010 --> 00:19:47.080
Finally, the time has come to use...

00:19:47.080 --> 00:19:49.740
...the forbidden Ninja Technique Memory Blast.

00:19:54.860 --> 00:19:56.080
Time out! Time out!

00:19:56.890 --> 00:19:59.920
Just kidding. It's a joke. A joke!

00:20:00.030 --> 00:20:01.860
Of course we wouldn't do it.

00:20:01.930 --> 00:20:05.800
Really? It's only the first episode.
I don't want to die.

00:20:06.870 --> 00:20:08.390
No fair! No fair!

00:20:08.770 --> 00:20:12.970
The guilty one will be tied up with a
rope and get dragged around by a jeep!

00:20:13.210 --> 00:20:17.510
Or... M-m-m-marry me!

00:20:17.510 --> 00:20:18.950
No!

00:20:18.950 --> 00:20:21.680
Oh no! Now is the time to use it!

00:20:21.850 --> 00:20:26.010
Ninja Technique Memory Blast!

00:20:33.760 --> 00:20:35.850
Beep beep, vroom vroom!

00:20:36.260 --> 00:20:37.490
Vroooom!

00:20:37.800 --> 00:20:40.290
Vroooom! Beep beep! Beep beep!

00:20:40.840 --> 00:20:42.440
Vroom-vroom? Vroom-vroom?

00:20:42.440 --> 00:20:44.560
Yup, that's a vroom-vroom.

00:20:45.340 --> 00:20:48.100
I guess you blasted away
more than just his memory.

00:20:48.940 --> 00:20:49.910
What's this screw from?

00:20:50.310 --> 00:20:51.340
I just found ten yen!

00:20:51.510 --> 00:20:54.240
We better hurry and find what Head Master lost.

00:20:54.580 --> 00:20:58.780
At this rate, I doubt Shinobu's
doing any real training.

00:21:03.260 --> 00:21:05.020
You have scars on your arm.

00:21:05.730 --> 00:21:06.750
Are you okay?

00:21:07.630 --> 00:21:10.660
Oh, this? It's a scar from my training.

00:21:10.970 --> 00:21:14.260
It's nothing. I have scars like this...

00:21:16.770 --> 00:21:18.500
...all over my body!

00:21:19.470 --> 00:21:21.340
You didn't need to get naked!

00:21:22.810 --> 00:21:26.210
To be a full-fledged ninja, this is nothing!

00:21:26.350 --> 00:21:27.510
Hey! Hey!

00:21:29.420 --> 00:21:31.320
I guess she's actually working hard.

00:21:33.350 --> 00:21:37.260
I'm going to take Kaede home!

00:21:38.260 --> 00:21:39.950
This again?!

00:21:47.270 --> 00:21:49.670
Bye-bye!

00:21:59.850 --> 00:22:01.040
Shuu tata shuu tata!

00:22:03.550 --> 00:22:04.310
Hurry up!

00:22:07.060 --> 00:22:08.250
Shuu tata shuu tata!

00:22:08.890 --> 00:22:09.910
Gather around!
Shugou

00:22:11.630 --> 00:22:18.500
Made it in the nick of time, I slid in
Giri giri seefu suberikonde

00:22:18.870 --> 00:22:25.470
I jumped over the tough morning
Kibishii asa wo tobikoeta

00:22:25.840 --> 00:22:28.430
"What you said yesterday..."
Kinou no hanashi

00:22:28.610 --> 00:22:32.510
"...might have been a little white lie,"you said
chotto dake uso kamo nante

00:22:33.780 --> 00:22:38.410
I definitely have a long way to go with my training,
Yappari shugyou busoku

00:22:39.190 --> 00:22:40.210
Let's do it!
Ganbarou

00:22:40.360 --> 00:22:44.230
Turn turn turn, one day I'll become great
Kuru kuru ri, rippa ni naru hi ga

00:22:44.230 --> 00:22:47.390
Turn turn turn, turn turn turn
Kuru kuru rii, kuru kuru rin

00:22:48.230 --> 00:22:50.930
It's okay
Daijoubu

00:22:51.170 --> 00:22:55.000
"With prayer, flowers bloom," someone said
Nenzureba hana hiraku nante

00:22:55.000 --> 00:22:58.200
It's an unreliable philosophy
Tayori nai hitori goto

00:22:59.070 --> 00:23:03.700
But I've got to try!
Demo ganbaranakucha

00:23:04.810 --> 00:23:05.970
Shuu tata shuu tata!

00:23:08.520 --> 00:23:09.380
Hurry up!

00:23:12.020 --> 00:23:13.110
Shuu tata shuu tata!

00:23:13.920 --> 00:23:14.790
Break it up!
Kaisan

00:23:17.530 --> 00:23:18.290
Hurry up!

00:23:20.960 --> 00:23:24.330
We met thanks to a weird exam question.

00:23:24.330 --> 00:23:25.630
What other questions were there?

00:23:25.630 --> 00:23:28.430
Let's see... Confess your love
under a legendary tree...

00:23:28.570 --> 00:23:30.260
On the forehead of Kinoshita's dog, you must...

00:23:30.570 --> 00:23:31.770
Oh, forget it! That's enough!

00:23:31.970 --> 00:23:36.100
All in all, it's thanks to Head
Master, I mean Onsokumaru, I guess...

00:23:36.340 --> 00:23:38.040
Next episode of 2x2=Shinobuden!

00:23:38.410 --> 00:23:40.640
"Ninjas Elated over Cherry
Blossom Viewing" and...

00:23:41.120 --> 00:23:43.280
..."Shinobu goes on a Date with Kaede".

00:23:43.520 --> 00:23:44.320
Onsokumaru is Head Master?

00:23:44.320 --> 00:23:45.220
Ninjas Elated over Cherry Blossom Viewing
Shinobu goes on a Date with Kaede
Onsokumaru is Head Master?

00:23:45.220 --> 00:23:47.690
Ninjas Elated over Cherry Blossom Viewing
Shinobu goes on a Date with Kaede
Kaede, you like to say
things that make no sense!

00:23:47.690 --> 00:23:49.090
Ninjas Elated over Cherry Blossom Viewing
Shinobu goes on a Date with Kaede
No way, you mean you...

00:23:49.090 --> 00:23:49.890
Ninjas Elated over Cherry Blossom Viewing
Shinobu goes on a Date with Kaede
